              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Iwadikatai aronis naka Yuda kakwara naka asuat; kaitesu naka ekukwai igirakinitai amor nuka itauonokee, ido amumwar nuka itemwanakec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
